& [Implementation] is a safe-Rust externalized reflection host
  + first llama.cpp pass receives exactly one required route_attention surface
  + host admits one exact closed call or fails before execution
  + an ephemeral reviewed MCP adapter returns either a verified learned frame or verified refusal
  + a separate llama.cpp pass imports that structured observation with tool calls disabled
