  + re-extracts final JSON and compares it with the recorded final output
  + requires exact state trajectories evidence linkage dependency identity and reasoning absence
  + inspect performs verification before projecting the compact walk
  + contract emits the exact cases paths limits profiles authority and excluded private fields without effects

& [TinyModelHardening] is bounded generation closure
